  "description": "\"I love to eat delicious food! Eating is my happiness!\" The food-loving protagonist, Sora Fukumi, needs to control her eating habits in school. By doing so, she thought to making friends, but while having dinner with her classmate and neighbor, Manjuu (Murai Mikoto), she again notices the wonders to eating delicious food... This is a chronicle of Fukumi, a gourmand who will learn through Manjuu's dinner!",
